        <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 12px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">
            FOR GUARDIAN / PARENT USERS:
        </h3>
        
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #374151; margin: 0 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
            By using the <strong>Web-Based AI-Assisted Individualized Education Plan Management and Generation System for Dreams Achievers Learning Center PH</strong>, designed to grant authorized guardians access to student developmental milestones, Individualized Education Plans (IEPs), daily logs, and home interventions, you agree to the following Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully to ensure you understand your rights, responsibilities, and data protections.
        </p>

        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #374151; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
            <li style="line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
                <strong>Account Responsibility and Security:</strong> You are responsible for maintaining the strict confidentiality of your login credentials (username and temporary/permanent passwords). You agree to comply with the mandatory initial password change upon your first login. Any unauthorized access, suspected compromise, or misuse of your account must be reported to the school administration immediately.
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
                <strong>Confidentiality of Sensitive Learner Data:</strong> Through the Parent Portal, you are granted secure access to sensitive developmental, behavioral, and academic records regarding your child. You agree not to disclose, publicly disseminate, re-upload, or share downloadable PDF reports, or associated learning objectives without appropriate authorization.
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
                <strong>Privacy and Protection of Visual Media:</strong> Classroom activity photos uploaded by teachers to document learning sessions are strictly protected and session-authenticated. You agree that any images displaying your child or fellow learners are strictly for personal monitoring only. Unauthorized downloading, posting, or republishing of these photos on public social media platforms or external channels is strictly prohibited.
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
                <strong>Collaborative Feedback Conduct:</strong> The platform provides a direct, two-way Collaborative Feedback thread attached to reports, IEP objectives, and School Announcements. You agree to utilize this communication channel in a professional, constructive, and respectful manner to facilitate coordinated learning between the classroom and home.
            </li>
            <li style="line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
                <strong>Non-Liability and Service Availability:</strong> The IEP Management System operates as an online, web-dependent platform requiring a stable internet connection. Dreams Achievers Learning Center PH and the system developers are not liable for temporary service interruptions, network-related delays in notifications or report updates.
            </li>
        </ul>
